OL,16,G0232 Tech Life
OL,17,     FWhat is a good age to give a child
OL,18,     Fa smartphone? A community in
OL,19,     FIreland might have the answer. In
OL,20,     FGreystones there's a voluntary
OL,21,     Fagreement to wait until secondary
OL,22,     Fschool age.
